{"seq":2,"slug":"conditional-coverage","title":"条件覆盖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/advanced/conditional-coverage","wordCount":1313,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"条件覆盖\">条件覆盖</h1><p>一个 CP 系统报告&quot;整体覆盖率 90%&quot;，监管者却问：对女性申请人覆盖多少？对罕见病样本覆盖多少？答案可能是 70% 和 60%——边际 90% 完全可以由&quot;多数群体超覆盖、少数群体欠覆盖&quot;拼凑而成。这正是 CP 最容易被误读、也最关乎公平的裂缝。本篇讲清边际覆盖与条件覆盖的天壤之别、为何完全条件覆盖在分布无关下被<strong>证明不可能</strong>、以及现实中如何在可行边界内逼近它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把两种覆盖并排写清。<strong>边际覆盖</strong>是 CP 的默认承诺，对所有样本平均：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y \\in C(X)) \\ge 1 - \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>条件覆盖</strong>要求对每个固定的特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 都成立：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>对所有 </mtext><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y \\in C(X) \\mid X = x) \\ge 1 - \\alpha \\quad \\text{对所有 } x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对所有</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>后者强得多——它禁止任何子群被系统性辜负。CP 默认只给前者，这一点在 <a href=\"../foundations/coverage-guarantee\">覆盖保证</a> 的证明里就埋下了：那条&quot;排名均匀&quot;是对联合分布而言的边际论证，天然不区分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[边际覆盖 90%&lt;br/&gt;对所有样本平均] --&gt; B{各子群分别看?}&#10;  B --&gt; C[多数群体 95%&lt;br/&gt;超覆盖]&#10;  B --&gt; D[少数群体 70%&lt;br/&gt;欠覆盖]&#10;  C --&gt; E[平均仍 90%&lt;br/&gt;边际承诺达标]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[但条件覆盖被破坏&lt;br/&gt;公平性问题]\">flowchart TD\n  A[边际覆盖 90%&lt;br/&gt;对所有样本平均] --&gt; B{各子群分别看?}\n  B --&gt; C[多数群体 95%&lt;br/&gt;超覆盖]\n  B --&gt; D[少数群体 70%&lt;br/&gt;欠覆盖]\n  C --&gt; E[平均仍 90%&lt;br/&gt;边际承诺达标]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[但条件覆盖被破坏&lt;br/&gt;公平性问题]</pre><h2 id=\"不可能性定理-完全条件覆盖买不到\">不可能性定理：完全条件覆盖买不到</h2><p>最关键的认知是：在<strong>分布无关</strong>设定下（即不对数据分布做任何假设，正是 CP 的卖点），对连续特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 实现非平凡的完全条件覆盖被证明是<strong>不可能</strong>的（Vovk 2012、Lei &amp; Wasserman 2014、Barber 等 2021）。直觉是：要对每个精确的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 都保证覆盖，而连续空间里每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 几乎都只对应有限甚至零个观测样本，无从校准；唯一能无条件成立条件覆盖的&quot;集合&quot;是平凡的全空间区间（无限宽），毫无信息量。这不是算法不够聪明，而是信息论级别的硬约束。承认它，才不会去追求一个不存在的免费午餐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在不可能性之内能做什么\">在不可能性之内能做什么</h2><p>不可能的是<strong>完全</strong>条件覆盖，但<strong>近似的、分组的</strong>条件覆盖可以争取。主流路径有三条，下表对比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>保证</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mondrian CP</td>\n<td>按预定义组分别校准</td>\n<td>每组内边际覆盖</td>\n<td>需定义组、每组够样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组条件 / 类条件</td>\n<td>对敏感属性或类别分别取阈值</td>\n<td>各组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>组数受样本量限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应评分（APS/CQR）</td>\n<td>评分编码难度，把覆盖摊匀</td>\n<td>逼近条件覆盖</td>\n<td>不保证，仅经验改善</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Mondrian CP 是最直接的可行解：把样本空间划成若干<strong>预先定义</strong>的组（如性别、类别、风险档），在每组内部独立做分裂共形。它给出&quot;每组各自的边际覆盖&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>——这正是组级别的条件覆盖，足以堵住公平性裂缝。代价是每组都得有足够校准样本，组分得越细越吃数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自适应评分为何只是-逼近\">自适应评分为何只是&quot;逼近&quot;</h2><p><a href=\"adaptive-prediction-sets\">自适应预测集 (APS)</a> 与 CQR 这类自适应评分常被宣传为&quot;改善条件覆盖&quot;——这准确但需要限定。它们通过让集合大小响应样本难度，把覆盖从&quot;集中在易样本&quot;摊向&quot;各难度层均匀&quot;，因此<strong>经验上</strong>各子群覆盖更接近名义值。但它们<strong>不提供条件覆盖的保证</strong>——不可能性定理对它们同样成立。它们做的是降低边际覆盖与条件覆盖之间的经验差距，而非消灭它。区分&quot;有保证的组条件（Mondrian）&quot;与&quot;无保证的经验改善（自适应评分）&quot;，是正确使用 CP 做公平性论证的分水岭：要写进合规报告的覆盖，必须用前者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与可解释性-漂移的边界\">与可解释性、漂移的边界</h2><p>条件覆盖的关切与模型公平性、可解释性高度相关——它问的是&quot;谁被系统辜负了&quot;，与 <a href=\"../explainable-ai/foundations/why-interpretability\">可解释 AI</a> 追问的&quot;模型对谁不公&quot;同源，但 CP 给的是覆盖层面的、可量化的答案，而非特征归因。另一个易混点：条件覆盖谈的是<strong>固定假设（可交换）下不同子群</strong>的覆盖差异；而当假设本身破裂（分布漂移），连边际覆盖都保不住，那是 <a href=\"../practice/distribution-shift\">分布漂移与加权</a> 的领域。两者别混：前者是&quot;假设成立但覆盖不均&quot;，后者是&quot;假设破裂覆盖塌方&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>边际覆盖（平均 90%）可由&quot;多数超覆盖 + 少数欠覆盖&quot;拼成，CP 默认只给边际，证明里即埋下此性质。</li>\n<li>分布无关下完全条件覆盖被证不可能——连续特征每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 几乎无样本可校准，非平凡条件覆盖买不到。</li>\n<li>可行替代：Mondrian / 组条件 CP 给<strong>有保证</strong>的组级边际覆盖（堵公平裂缝），代价是吃数据。</li>\n<li>自适应评分（APS/CQR）只<strong>逼近</strong>条件覆盖、经验改善子群差距，不提供保证——合规报告须用 Mondrian。</li>\n<li>条件覆盖谈&quot;假设成立但覆盖不均&quot;，与&quot;假设破裂覆盖塌方&quot;的漂移问题不同，勿混。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>逼近条件覆盖的自适应评分：<a href=\"adaptive-prediction-sets\">自适应预测集 (APS)</a></li>\n<li>边际覆盖的原始证明为何天然非条件：<a href=\"../foundations/coverage-guarantee\">覆盖保证</a></li>\n<li>&quot;谁被模型辜负&quot;的另一种回答：<a href=\"../explainable-ai/foundations/why-interpretability\">为何需要可解释性</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"条件覆盖","id":"条件覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不可能性定理：完全条件覆盖买不到","id":"不可能性定理-完全条件覆盖买不到"},{"level":2,"text":"在不可能性之内能做什么","id":"在不可能性之内能做什么"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应评分为何只是\"逼近\"","id":"自适应评分为何只是-逼近"},{"level":2,"text":"与可解释性、漂移的边界","id":"与可解释性-漂移的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"自适应预测集 (APS)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/advanced/adaptive-prediction-sets"},"next":{"title":"分类与回归共形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/advanced/classification-regression"}}